{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 5, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt arise and make thy way to the airport, where thy journey to Japan doth begin.\n\n\nThe skies shalt be thy highway, as thou soar above the clouds, leaving behind thy familiar lands.\n\n\nUpon arrival in Tokyo, thy first destination, thou shalt rest and gather thy strength for the adventures that await.\n\n\nThe following day, visit the Meiji Shrine, a place of great spiritual significance, dedicated to the deified spirits of Emperor Meiji and his wife, Empress Shōken.\n\n\nExplore the bustling streets of Shibuya, where countless souls cross the famous scramble crossing, a sight to behold.\n\n\nJourney to the neighborhood of Asakusa, where the ancient and modern worlds converge, and visit the Sensō-ji, Tokyo's oldest temple.\n\n\nPartake in a traditional tea ceremony, an elegant and graceful experience that shall transport thou back in time.\n\n\nOn the fifth day, venture to Nikko, a city nestled in the mountains, where thou shalt find the Toshogu Shrine, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, dedicated to the founder of the Tokugawa shogunate.\n\n\nThe following day, visit the historic town of Hakone, where thou shalt take a scenic cruise on Lake Ashi and marvel at the majestic Mount Fuji.\n\n\nOn the seventh day, return to Tokyo and prepare for thy departure the following day.\n\n\nThy journey to Japan, a land of beauty, history, and culture, shall be an unforgettable experience. Fare thee well and may good fortune follow thee on thy travels.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.3254517912864685}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.020623529329895973}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -1.5643638372421265}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -1.1920922133867862e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.12775583565235138}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.001209242851473391}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.018707504495978355}, {"